---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import {snapshot} from '../lib/snapshot';import {safeUrl} from '../lib/document';
---
<Layout title="作品"><section class="container page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">THINGS I'VE MADE</span><h1>把想法做出来<span class="heading-dot">.</span></h1><p>我的项目、工具，以及从想法做成的作品。</p></section><section class="container section-bottom">{snapshot.settings.projects.length?<div class="post-grid">{snapshot.settings.projects.map((project,i)=><article class="project-card"><span class="eyebrow">PROJECT {String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h2>{project.title}</h2><p>{project.description}</p>{safeUrl(project.url)&&<a class="text-link" href={safeUrl(project.url)} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">查看作品 ↗</a>}</article>)}</div>:<div class="empty-state"><span class="empty-symbol">✳</span><h3>一些想法，正在成为作品。</h3><p>整理好后，会在这里分享。</p></div>}</section></Layout>
